.TH IP-AUDIT-LIST 1 "November 2026" "Kea IP Audit Hook" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ip-audit-list \- list unexpired allocations inferred from Kea audit logs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ip-audit-list
[
.B --at
.I TIMESTAMP
]
.I LOGS
[
.I LOGS
...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ip-audit-list
reconstructs allocations from Kea IP audit JSON records and writes a JSON snapshot
of allocations that have not expired at the selected time. It reads plain JSON Lines
files and gzip-compressed files.
.PP
A log base path includes that file and its numbered rotations, including gzip-compressed
rotations (for example,
.BR ip-audit.log.1.gz ).
You may instead supply explicit files or a quoted shell glob pattern. Multiple log
specifications may be supplied. Events after the snapshot time are ignored.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --at " TIMESTAMP"
Select the snapshot time using an ISO 8601 timestamp that includes a timezone. The
default is the current time in UTC.
.TP
.B -h, --help
Show the help message and exit.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I LOGS
One or more log files, base log paths, or quoted glob patterns. A base path includes
that file and its numbered or gzip-compressed rotations.
.SH OUTPUT
Writes a JSON object to standard output with the snapshot time, source, allocation count,
and leases. Each lease contains its network, start and end times, and latest audit record.
Allocations with unknown expiry are omitted with a warning on standard error.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The snapshot was produced, including when it contains no allocations.
.TP
.B 2
Invalid input or an unreadable or malformed log.
.SH LIMITATIONS
This is an inferred snapshot from available audit logs, not a query to Kea's live lease
database. Missing, filtered, dropped, or not-yet-written events can make it incomplete
or stale. Retain all events and the timestamp, event, IP address, lease expiry, and client
identity fields. Logs describing independent allocation domains with overlapping
addresses should be queried separately. Full logs are loaded into memory.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
ip-audit-list /var/log/kea/ip-audit.log /var/log/kea/ip-audit6.log
ip-audit-list /var/log/kea/ip-audit.log --at 2026-11-04T12:00:00Z
ip-audit-list /var/log/kea/ip-audit.log > allocations.json
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ip-audit-lookup (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Kea IP Audit Hook contributors.